# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## What This Is

A multi-agent financial research operation ("Prome") tracking systemic risk transmission. The system detects stress transmission early enough to position ahead of consensus using publicly sourced data. The operator is Will (Eastern timezone). The AI coordinator is Prome (Opus), which spawns domain-specialist sub-agents (Sonnet) for research.

## Boot Sequence

At session start, follow `PROME/BOOT.md`:
1. Read `PROME/SCRATCH.md` (ephemeral scratchpad — read FIRST)
2. Read `PROME/STATUS.md` (dashboard, positions, priorities)
3. Read `LESSONS.md` (mistakes to avoid)
4. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today's daily notes)

Before `/clear`: append checkpoint to daily notes + git commit.
Before `/new`: full handoff per `PROME/HANDOFF.md` — update SCRATCH, daily notes, STATUS, MEMORY.

## Injected Files

These files are always injected into context and do NOT need to be re-read at boot: `AGENTS.md`, `SOUL.md`, `USER.md`, `HEARTBEAT.md`, `MEMORY.md`.

## Architecture

```
WILL (Telegram) → PROME (Opus, coordinator) → Research Agents (Sonnet, domain workers)
```

**Transmission chain:** LABOR → CARL → REGINALD → market repricing. HENRY (speed), LIQUID (amplification), SAM (Japan, parallel trigger), HAWK → BRENT (oil/energy).

**Agent tiers:**
- **Tier 1 (dedicated instances):** PROME, LABOR, CARL, REGINALD, SAM, HENRY, LIQUID, BROCK, BRENT, HAWK
- **Tier 2 (file-based):** CORAL, CREED, MARCO, BARON, SHADE, NEXUS, and others

Agents live at `AGENTS/<NAME>/STATUS.md`. Sub-agents at `AGENTS/<PARENT>/<SUB>/`. FORGE (trade execution) at `FORGE/STATUS.md`.

## Spawning Agents

```
sessions_spawn(agentId="<id>", task="...", cleanup="keep")
```
Check STATUS.md is <10KB before spawning (prune if needed). Domain agents cannot spawn other agents, message externally, or schedule themselves — only PROME can.

Agent IDs: labor, carl, reginald, brock, henry, liquid, sam, zhao, hans, nexus, hawk, brent, marco, shade, hermes, darwin, otto, red, athena.

